   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Testing-only workflow for the sweep harness; hidden from the template browser. Based on dgx-monarch-minimax-h3-image-t2i, with only the changes needed for this test. Sampler Custom (DGX Monarch) walks the checkpoint's own sigma grid, typed into Manual Sigmas, where the shipped graph's KSampler lands within a thousandth of it; euler through Basic Guider (DGX Monarch) at CFG 1. The first-use gate proves this graph with its own first two steps, 1.0 to 0.9675 to 0.8875, each on one head block as in the render, where the shipped graph's two-step KSampler proof spans three blocks a step. The expander is off, so the request reaches the model as written."
   ],
   "title": "DGX Monarch | MiniMax-H3-Image on its sigma grid"
  },
